!**************************************************************************************
!  
! A reduced model for ethylene air detonation simulation.  
!  
!  
! Ethylene-air combustion model with am emphasis on predicting detonation (~50 bar)  
! and deflagration (3 bar), extracted and calibrated against FFCMY-9a.  
!  
! Rui Xu, Yue Zhang, Hai Wang, Stanford University  
! March 2020
! Please contact Hai Wang at haiwang@stanford.edu for questions and comments.  
!  
!**************************************************************************************  
ELEMENTS   
H  C  N  O   
END   
